Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.48,0:00:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,, 《行尸走肉》前情提要\N{\fnArial\fs30}Previously on AMC's The Walking Dead...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.78,0:00:06.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 动他可能会情况恶化  - 那怎么做能让他好转呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Moving him could make him worse.  - What will make him better?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.78,0:00:07.78,Default,,0,0,0,,让他醒过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Waking up.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.78,0:00:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,我以为你很弱 但你向我证明了我是错的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I thought you were weak. You've proved me wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.88,0:00:12.38,Default,,0,0,0,,这是药柜的钥匙\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is to the drug locker.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.68,0:00:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,你要救那个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You are gonna save that woman's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.18,0:00:16.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这个丹只是想维持现在的状态 对吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}This Dawn, she's just trying to keep it together, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.69,0:00:19.18,Default,,0,0,0,,如果我们能活捉几个警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}If we get a couple of her cops alive,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.79,0:00:23.28,Default,,0,0,0,,就能公平交易 他们的人换我们的\N{\fnArial\fs30}we do an even trade. Theirs for ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.29,0:00:24.49,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都能安然回家\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody goes home.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.59,0:00:26.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我了解这个女人 让我帮你们\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know this woman. Let me help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.47,0:01:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.58,0:01:37.92,Default,,0,0,0,,立刻站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.25,0:01:40.75,Default,,0,0,0,,站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.76,0:01:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,最后一遍\N{\fnArial\fs30}I won't ask again.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.31,0:01:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.18,0:02:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.31,0:02:07.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你个混蛋 帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You son of a bitch. Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.50,0:02:10.55,Default,,0,0,0,,混蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.55,0:02:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,帮帮我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.47,0:02:17.09,Default,,0,0,0,,你个... 疯子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You crazy... you crazy son of a bitch.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.56,0:02:20.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我觉得... 你撞伤了我的后背\N{\fnArial\fs30}I think you... I think you broke my back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.81,0:02:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,又不是非得撞你的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Didn't have to be like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.98,0:02:25.02,Default,,0,0,0,,你得站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just had to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.60,0:02:29.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我不能停 我不了解你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I couldn't. I don't know you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.61,0:02:34.83,Default,,0,0,0,,但我觉得... 我现在了解了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But I think... I think I'm getting the idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.83,0:02:36.83,Default,,0,0,0,,你得听话站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}You just had to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.83,0:02:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,带我回去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.20,0:02:41.28,Default,,0,0,0,,带我回医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Take me back to the hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.78,0:02:46.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我是为了你朋友那么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I did it for your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.21,0:02:49.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你逃了 就没机会了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not after this, no.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.51,0:02:51.59,Default,,0,0,0,,没后悔药 鲍勃\N{\fnArial\fs30}Can't go back, Bob.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.80,0:02:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,我本来想解决好这事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was gonna iron it over.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.47,0:03:02.22,Default,,0,0,0,,就拿她来开刀\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's under it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.31,0:03:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你出来太久了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you've been out here too long.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.65,0:03:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,你会死的 你们都会...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You'll die. You'll all...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.99,0:03:20.95,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shut up.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.99,0:04:08.39,Default,,0,0,0,,《行尸走肉》
Dialogue: 0,0:06:42.57,0:06:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,求求你们!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.82,0:06:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,让我进去!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.74,0:06:49.69,Default,,0,0,0,,求求你们! 让我进去!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! Let me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.70,0:06:52.20,Default,,0,0,0,,他们逼近了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're close!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.20,0:06:54.20,Default,,0,0,0,,救命! 他们来了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help! They're coming!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.54,0:06:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,请别把我一个人留在外面!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please don't leave me out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.54,0:07:01.34,Default,,0,0,0,,求求你们!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.34,0:07:04.21,Default,,0,0,0,,请别把我留在外面!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't leave me out here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.21,0:07:06.88,Default,,0,0,0,,卡尔! 米琼恩! 救命!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl! Michonne!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.88,0:07:09.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我必须得看看! 我现在明白了!\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to see it! I know now!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.22,0:07:10.77,Default,,0,0,0,,让我带着罪孽活下去!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me live with it!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.77,0:07:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,神啊 救救我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.94,0:07:15.02,Default,,0,0,0,,- 等等  - 救命!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Wait.  - Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.02,0:07:18.39,Default,,0,0,0,,让我进去! 天啊 求求你们!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me in! Oh, God, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:18.39,0:07:22.06,Default,,0,0,0,,救我! 救命!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.06,0:07:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,卡尔! 米琼恩! 救命!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Carl! Michonne!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.86,0:07:26.73,Default,,0,0,0,,后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.73,0:07:29.57,Default,,0,0,0,,求求你们! 救命!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please! Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.57,0:07:31.70,Default,,0,0,0,,救命!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.70,0:07:33.70,Default,,0,0,0,,救救我!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.62,0:07:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊 求求你们!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, God, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.58,0:07:41.08,Default,,0,0,0,,让我进去! 让我进去!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let me in! Let me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.92,0:07:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,救救我!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.30,0:07:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,求求你们 让我进去!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Please, let me in!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.42,0:07:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,- 求求你们!  - 快点!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Please!  - Come on!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.26,0:07:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,救命!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.09,0:07:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,后退\N{\fnArial\fs30}Get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.16,0:08:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,去教区长的房间\N{\fnArial\fs30}The rectory, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.63,0:08:30.68,Default,,0,0,0,,我就是这么出去的 从下面爬出去\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how I got out. Crawl under to the back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.68,0:08:32.60,Default,,0,0,0,,快走 带上小孩走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just go. Take the little one and go.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.04,0:08:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,嘿 嘿 在外面等我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hey, hey. You wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.15,0:08:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,一切都值得\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's worth it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.99,0:08:57.87,Default,,0,0,0,,我会等你走了再松手\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not going anywhere until you're gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.85,0:09:31.69,Default,,0,0,0,,- 来吧  - 我没法跑了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Come on.  - I can't run anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.69,0:09:33.69,Default,,0,0,0,,我们不跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're not running.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.09,0:10:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,他不肯站住\N{\fnArial\fs30}He wouldn't stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.06,0:10:36.73,Default,,0,0,0,,那得改计划了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}This change things?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.73,0:10:38.59,Default,,0,0,0,,必须得改\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has to.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.35,0:10:44.10,Default,,0,0,0,,也许不用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe not.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.10,0:10:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,她说计划没法成功 觉得能成功的家伙死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}She said the plan won't work. The guy who did is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.90,0:10:49.07,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我们该重新考虑一下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe we gotta rethink this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.07,0:10:52.49,Default,,0,0,0,,他们也说了 管事的警察不喜欢他\N{\fnArial\fs30}They also said the cop in charge didn't have any love for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.49,0:10:55.28,Default,,0,0,0,,也许你帮了她个忙\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe you did her a favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.28,0:10:57.36,Default,,0,0,0,,我不知道他们会不会耍花样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't know if they'll play ball.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.00,0:11:01.00,Default,,0,0,0,,问问就知道了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's find out.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:09.46,0:11:11.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was a good man.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:15.21,0:11:17.52,Default,,0,0,0,,他被行尸袭击了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was attacked by rotters.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.52,0:11:19.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们看着他死的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Saw it go down.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.61,0:11:27.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你撒谎真厉害\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a damn good liar.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.23,0:11:28.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我们现在命悬一线\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're hanging by a thread here.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.61,0:11:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,他是被行尸袭击了 就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was attacked by rotters. That's the story.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.15,0:11:33.20,Default,,0,0,0,,你说过 交易是个坏主意\N{\fnArial\fs30}You said the trade was a bad idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.20,0:11:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,什么变了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What changed?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.15,0:11:37.15,Default,,0,0,0,,拉姆森原本是我们的希望\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lamson was our shot.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.15,0:11:40.21,Default,,0,0,0,,现在要不就帮你们 要不你们就杀进去 对吧?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's this or you go in guns blazing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.21,0:11:41.91,Default,,0,0,0,,你不想让我们杀进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't want that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.91,0:11:43.49,Default,,0,0,0,,如果你敢胡说八道\N{\fnArial\fs30}If this is some bullshit you're spinning
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.49,0:11:45.88,Default,,0,0,0,,- 计划失败...  - 我知道\N{\fnArial\fs30}- and things go south...  - I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:45.88,0:11:48.71,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道哪些是好警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know the good ones from the bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.72,0:11:50.92,Default,,0,0,0,,让我们帮你\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let us help you.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.41,0:11:58.26,Default,,0,0,0,,那你呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.89,0:12:02.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你想活吗? 有多想?\N{\fnArial\fs30}You wanna live? How much?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.23,0:12:08.65,Default,,0,0,0,,丹害怕让我们觉得她很脆弱\N{\fnArial\fs30}Dawn's afraid she'll look weak in front of us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:09.85,0:12:11.94,Default,,0,0,0,,觉得这会让我们反抗她\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thinks it'll tip things against her.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:13.16,0:12:16.02,Default,,0,0,0,,的确如此\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hell, it will.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.24,0:12:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,如果她觉得你们杀了我们的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}She'll see this trade as a rip-off
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.58,0:12:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,就会认为这个交易是在敲诈\N{\fnArial\fs30}if she thinks you took out one of our guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.03,0:12:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,所以幸好拉姆森是被行尸杀掉的\N{\fnArial\fs30}So it's a good thing Lamson got aced by rotters.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:34.21,0:12:37.21,Default,,0,0,0,,谢帕德 还有拉姆森 你们在哪儿?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Shepherd, Lamson, what's your 20?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.22,0:12:43.02,Default,,0,0,0,,汇报之前的枪声是怎么回事 听到吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I need status on that gunfire. Do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.36,0:12:48.77,Default,,0,0,0,,利卡里 听到吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Licari, do you copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.36,0:12:52.73,Default,,0,0,0,,有人听到吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Does anybody copy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.23,0:12:58.57,Default,,0,0,0,,该死\N{\fnArial\fs30}Damn it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.57,0:13:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,出问题了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Something wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.24,0:13:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,他们有时候就是不回话\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't always radio back
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.58,0:13:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,我都快疯了\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it drives me crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.96,0:13:13.08,Default,,0,0,0,,等等 别 别 Beth 别放那儿\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait, no, no, no. Beth, no, not there.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.55,0:13:16.72,Default,,0,0,0,,放警徽旁边\N{\fnArial\fs30}Up by the badges.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.84,0:13:19.47,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.43,0:13:26.64,Default,,0,0,0,,这是汉森队长吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is this Captain Hanson?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:30.27,0:13:33.57,Default,,0,0,0,,有人告诉过你他的事情吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Did someone say something about him to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.57,0:13:36.49,Default,,0,0,0,,我只听说以前是他管事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just that he used to be in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.49,0:13:39.44,Default,,0,0,0,,你会听到他的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, you'll hear stories about him.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.74,0:13:44.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我的故事\N{\fnArial\fs30}About me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:44.61,0:13:46.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我都做了些什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}About what I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:56.46,0:13:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我的良师\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was my mentor.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.85,0:14:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,益友\N{\fnArial\fs30}My friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.30,0:14:08.30,Default,,0,0,0,,我很想他\N{\fnArial\fs30}I miss him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.31,0:14:11.77,Default,,0,0,0,,传闻里面没包括这些\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's the part the stories leave out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.78,0:14:13.48,Default,,0,0,0,,他怎么了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to him?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.53,0:14:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,每次外出行动\N{\fnArial\fs30}They risk their lives
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.82,0:14:24.24,Default,,0,0,0,,他们都冒着生命危险\N{\fnArial\fs30}every time they go out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.24,0:14:26.37,Default,,0,0,0,,冒险总得有意义 有结果\N{\fnArial\fs30}It has to be worth it. It has to matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.96,0:14:29.82,Default,,0,0,0,,但是他忽视了这一点\N{\fnArial\fs30}He lost sight of that.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.38,0:14:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,所以他也失去了人心\N{\fnArial\fs30}So he lost them.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.46,0:14:37.08,Default,,0,0,0,,贝斯 做我这活的人并不需要他人的爱戴...\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beth, in this job you don't need their love...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.08,0:14:41.64,Default,,0,0,0,,但是一定得赢得他们的尊重\N{\fnArial\fs30}but you have to have their respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.26,0:14:45.01,Default,,0,0,0,,否则 总有一天\N{\fnArial\fs30}Otherwise, the day is gonna come
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.01,0:14:47.31,Default,,0,0,0,,在你需要的时候 你却找不到后盾\N{\fnArial\fs30}when you need backup and you don't have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.31,0:14:49.43,Default,,0,0,0,,接下来呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what comes next?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.15,0:14:53.65,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都得完蛋\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everybody goes down.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.02,0:15:01.19,Default,,0,0,0,,汉森迷失了自我\N{\fnArial\fs30}Hanson lost his way.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.19,0:15:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.19,0:15:24.36,Default,,0,0,0,,你去哪了?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where did you go?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.13,0:15:28.38,Default,,0,0,0,,学校\N{\fnArial\fs30}The school.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.39,0:15:30.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我得亲眼看看\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to see.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.22,0:15:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,我得弄清楚\N{\fnArial\fs30}I had to know.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.90,0:15:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,我们往哪跑?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where do we go?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.11,0:16:31.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 你没事吧?  - 没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You okay?  - Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.42,0:16:39.29,Default,,0,0,0,,你们回来了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're back.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.29,0:16:41.92,Default,,0,0,0,,尤金说谎了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Eugene lied.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:41.93,0:16:44.68,Default,,0,0,0,,他没法挽救这一切\N{\fnArial\fs30}He can't stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.68,0:16:46.93,Default,,0,0,0,,华盛顿没有终结一切的办法\N{\fnArial\fs30}Washington isn't the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.30,0:16:51.13,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都在哪?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where is everybody?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.97,0:16:59.94,Default,,0,0,0,,贝斯还活着 她在亚特兰大的一个医院里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beth's alive. She's in a hospital in Atlanta.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.94,0:17:02.64,Default,,0,0,0,,有人带走了她 其他人都去救她了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Some people have her, but the others went to get her back.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.65,0:17:04.65,Default,,0,0,0,,知道是哪个医院吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Do we know which one?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.65,0:17:06.45,Default,,0,0,0,,格雷迪纪念医院\N{\fnArial\fs30}Grady Memorial.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.95,0:17:13.87,Default,,0,0,0,,天啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.66,0:17:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们快点走吧 去救你的妹妹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Let's blow this joint, go save your sister.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.33,0:17:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,不 帕西 告诉我 你还要我说得清楚点吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Percy, tell me. Should I use smaller words?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.00,0:17:30.84,Default,,0,0,0,,把我袖子上破洞补好 这指令太难吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is the directive fix the hole in my sleeve too complicated for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.84,0:17:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,- 抱歉 我忘记了  - 好啊 那就听好了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I'm sorry. I forgot.  - Well, here's an idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.76,0:17:34.23,Default,,0,0,0,,不许忘记\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.01,0:17:37.85,Default,,0,0,0,,你怎么样?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.85,0:17:39.98,Default,,0,0,0,,- 针线活好不好?  - 我需要她\N{\fnArial\fs30}- You any good with needle and thread?  - I need her.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.98,0:17:42.65,Default,,0,0,0,,不好意思 我们有好多活要干 走吧 Beth\N{\fnArial\fs30}Sorry, we have a lot of work to do. Come on, Beth.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.85,0:18:09.39,Default,,0,0,0,,帕西会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Percy's going to be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.76,0:18:12.56,Default,,0,0,0,,什么都不会没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nothing's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.90,0:18:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,你要跳下去吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Are you going to jump?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.83,0:18:23.34,Default,,0,0,0,,我就想一个人静静\N{\fnArial\fs30}I wanted to be alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.34,0:18:26.41,Default,,0,0,0,,正好你把电梯钥匙留在了原处\N{\fnArial\fs30}You left your elevator key where it was.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.68,0:18:30.81,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你哪也不会去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, I know you're not going anywhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.71,0:18:35.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Neither are you.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.35,0:18:42.42,Default,,0,0,0,,你...\N{\fnArial\fs30}You...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.42,0:18:45.71,Default,,0,0,0,,你总是说服自己为了等这场噩梦过去\N{\fnArial\fs30}you keep telling yourself you have to do whatever it takes
Dialogue: 0,0:18:45.71,0:18:48.04,Default,,0,0,0,,要不计代价\N{\fnArial\fs30}just until this is all over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.66,0:18:52.58,Default,,0,0,0,,但不可能结束的\N{\fnArial\fs30}But it isn't over.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.58,0:18:54.53,Default,,0,0,0,,就是这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.54,0:18:58.07,Default,,0,0,0,,一切结束之前 你不会变 这地方也不会变\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is who you are and what this place is until the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.07,0:19:00.74,Default,,0,0,0,,这地方救了你的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}This place saved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.68,0:19:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我救了你的命\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saved you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.28,0:19:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,两次\N{\fnArial\fs30}Twice.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:07.07,0:19:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,其他人不知道你做了什么\N{\fnArial\fs30}The others don't know what you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.02,0:19:15.69,Default,,0,0,0,,他们以为琼是要背叛我\N{\fnArial\fs30}They think Joan was trying to get back at me
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.69,0:19:19.16,Default,,0,0,0,,以为戈尔曼和杰弗里斯当了替死鬼\N{\fnArial\fs30}and that Gorman and Jeffries were in the wrong place at the wrong time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.16,0:19:21.28,Default,,0,0,0,,- 事情就是这样的  - 胡说\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's what happened.  - Bullshit.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.28,0:19:24.83,Default,,0,0,0,,我看到碎罐子了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I saw the smashed jar.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.83,0:19:28.70,Default,,0,0,0,,我关了办公室 在别人发现前处理掉了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I closed up my office and I fixed it before it could be a problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.54,0:19:33.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你杀了个警察\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're a cop killer.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.04,0:19:35.46,Default,,0,0,0,,- 我不会杀人的  - 但是你杀了\N{\fnArial\fs30}- I would never kill somebody.  - But you did.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.38,0:19:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,你知不知道 别人要是发现了会怎么样?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What do you think would happen if the others found out?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.88,0:19:43.38,Default,,0,0,0,,是我保护了你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I protected you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.80,0:19:47.39,Default,,0,0,0,,而且我们救了那个病人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And we helped that patient.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.39,0:19:49.72,Default,,0,0,0,,我没必要那么做 但是我想要\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't have to, I wanted to.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.72,0:19:51.69,Default,,0,0,0,,但是这里的事都要按规矩来\N{\fnArial\fs30}But there's a way things have to happen here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.69,0:19:54.23,Default,,0,0,0,,你不明白吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't you get that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.74,0:20:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你想干什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.24,0:20:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,不 丹 是你想干什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, Dawn, what are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.88,0:20:12.63,Default,,0,0,0,,先从她开始说\N{\fnArial\fs30}Starting with her.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.63,0:20:14.46,Default,,0,0,0,,她是我的人 这是我的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}She's my ward. It's my call.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:14.47,0:20:18.84,Default,,0,0,0,,好吧 但是这里的人得知道他们在为谁干活\N{\fnArial\fs30}Fine, but your people deserve to know who they're working for.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.84,0:20:21.39,Default,,0,0,0,,是你去告诉他们 还是我来?\N{\fnArial\fs30}So, you gonna tell them or am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.84,0:20:26.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你别威胁我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You don't get to threaten me.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.59,0:20:29.26,Default,,0,0,0,,这不是威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not a threat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.26,0:20:31.31,Default,,0,0,0,,但这都是事实 你的状况糟透了\N{\fnArial\fs30}But these are the facts. You look like shit.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:31.32,0:20:32.93,Default,,0,0,0,,大家都在议论你 觉得你要崩溃了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The guys are talking. They think you're cracking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.93,0:20:34.73,Default,,0,0,0,,又要变成汉森那时一样了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is Hanson all over again.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.65,0:20:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,是时候改变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's time to make a change.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.52,0:20:41.19,Default,,0,0,0,,停下 奥唐纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}O'Donnell.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.19,0:20:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:45.86,0:20:48.61,Default,,0,0,0,,我一点都不像汉森\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm nothing like Hanson.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.20,0:20:53.25,Default,,0,0,0,,是我杀了他 你记得吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was the one who killed him, remember that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.25,0:20:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我是唯一一个能那么做的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was the only one who could go through with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.96,0:21:05.97,Default,,0,0,0,,放下你的武器 丹\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lower your weapon, Dawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.97,0:21:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,不然我就要喊了\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I have to do is shout.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.69,0:21:09.80,Default,,0,0,0,,那我会说是你来找我麻烦\N{\fnArial\fs30}All I have to do is say you came at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.80,0:21:11.14,Default,,0,0,0,,贝斯 到安全的地方去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beth, get out of the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.47,0:21:15.53,Default,,0,0,0,,你不会开枪的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not gonna do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.53,0:21:17.69,Default,,0,0,0,,是你逼我的\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not giving me a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.53,0:21:22.40,Default,,0,0,0,,过来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.95,0:21:28.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我们当年是同期的新人\N{\fnArial\fs30}We were rookies together.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.32,0:21:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,你也认识我的妻子\N{\fnArial\fs30}You knew my wife.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.16,0:21:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,我孩子刚出生的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were here in this hospital
Dialogue: 0,0:21:33.75,0:21:37.00,Default,,0,0,0,,你也在这个医院 我们在停车场一起抽过烟\N{\fnArial\fs30}having cigars with me in the parking lot when my kid was born.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.00,0:21:39.67,Default,,0,0,0,,闭嘴\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.67,0:21:42.05,Default,,0,0,0,,那个你已经不在了\N{\fnArial\fs30}That guy is gone.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.05,0:21:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我们本该保护大家的\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're supposed to protect people.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.42,0:21:47.84,Default,,0,0,0,,帮助他们\N{\fnArial\fs30}To help them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.84,0:21:50.43,Default,,0,0,0,,可是 看看你\N{\fnArial\fs30}But look at you.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.35,0:21:55.01,Default,,0,0,0,,你竟然殴打老人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're beating the old man.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.27,0:21:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,那个可怜姑娘被强奸的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're laughing with your buddies
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.35,0:22:02.24,Default,,0,0,0,,你竟然和兄弟一起大笑\N{\fnArial\fs30}about that poor girl getting raped.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:03.91,0:22:06.58,Default,,0,0,0,,- 那才是现在的你  - 那你又是什么东西?\N{\fnArial\fs30}- That's who you are now.  - So who the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.58,0:22:09.25,Default,,0,0,0,,不会放纵这一切发生的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Somebody who's not gonna let it happen anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.25,0:22:11.45,Default,,0,0,0,,这都不是关键\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's not what this is about.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.87,0:22:16.54,Default,,0,0,0,,关键是要紧抓住仅有的东西不放\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's about holding on to what you have.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.54,0:22:19.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我还剩下什么?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What the hell do I have?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.59,0:22:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,你已经不是你了\N{\fnArial\fs30}This isn't you.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.96,0:22:27.55,Default,,0,0,0,,汉森死掉之后 你就变了\N{\fnArial\fs30}After Hanson, you changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.95,0:22:51.32,Default,,0,0,0,,你觉得你比我们强?!\N{\fnArial\fs30}You think you're better than us?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.91,0:22:55.11,Default,,0,0,0,,管好你自己的事 婊子!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stay in your lane, bitch!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.41,0:22:59.83,Default,,0,0,0,,贝斯 推下去!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beth!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.81,0:23:13.73,Default,,0,0,0,,谢谢\N{\fnArial\fs30}Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:44.45,0:23:46.62,Default,,0,0,0,,哭出来没事的\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay to cry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.67,0:23:50.01,Default,,0,0,0,,我不会再哭了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't cry anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.01,0:23:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,我会\N{\fnArial\fs30}I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.13,0:23:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,只是不让别人看到罢了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I just don't let them see it.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.47,0:24:03.39,Default,,0,0,0,,这是我自己的东西\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's from my own stash.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:03.39,0:24:05.19,Default,,0,0,0,,不用你干活来换\N{\fnArial\fs30}There's no strings.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.98,0:24:12.28,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你为什么替我隐瞒\N{\fnArial\fs30}I know now why you covered for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.07,0:24:18.28,Default,,0,0,0,,你不是在保护我\N{\fnArial\fs30}You weren't protecting me.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:19.82,0:24:21.52,Default,,0,0,0,,你是在保护你自己\N{\fnArial\fs30}You were protecting yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:25.46,0:24:27.26,Default,,0,0,0,,是吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that so?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:27.26,0:24:31.20,Default,,0,0,0,,不管是戈尔曼 杰弗里斯 还是奥唐纳\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gorman, Jeffries, O'Donnell...
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.20,0:24:33.23,Default,,0,0,0,,他们对你来说是威胁\N{\fnArial\fs30}they were problems for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.23,0:24:34.87,Default,,0,0,0,,但现在不是了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And now they're not.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.44,0:24:38.60,Default,,0,0,0,,而你还不用亲自动手\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you didn't have to do the dirty work.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:43.44,0:24:45.68,Default,,0,0,0,,这就是这里的处事方式\N{\fnArial\fs30}That's how things get done here.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.68,0:24:49.48,Default,,0,0,0,,人人都为了自己想要的东西而互相利用\N{\fnArial\fs30}Everyone uses people to get what they want.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.48,0:24:51.92,Default,,0,0,0,,你自己就不用记得那些被杀掉的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're not the ones who have to remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:51.92,0:24:55.69,Default,,0,0,0,,爱德华和特雷维特的事也是这样吗?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Is that what happened with Edwards and Trevitt?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:55.69,0:24:57.72,Default,,0,0,0,,他利用了你?\N{\fnArial\fs30}He used you?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.40,0:25:07.90,Default,,0,0,0,,我会出去的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm gonna get out.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:07.90,0:25:09.84,Default,,0,0,0,,就像诺亚一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:12.24,0:25:14.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}He'll be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:14.11,0:25:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,- 他要回家了  - 他们总会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}- He's going home.  - They always come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:18.98,0:25:20.85,Default,,0,0,0,,他们根本走不远 因为他们没办法走远\N{\fnArial\fs30}They don't ever get far because they can't.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:20.85,0:25:23.73,Default,,0,0,0,,但真正的原因是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}But really...
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.74,0:25:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,他们不想离开\N{\fnArial\fs30}they don't want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.02,0:25:28.24,Default,,0,0,0,,他要回家了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's going home.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:34.24,0:25:37.86,Default,,0,0,0,,我年轻时跟你一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was like you when I was younger.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:40.67,0:25:43.17,Default,,0,0,0,,谁的话也听不进去\N{\fnArial\fs30}Nobody could tell me anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.37,0:25:47.09,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在不傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm not stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:49.18,0:25:51.04,Default,,0,0,0,,你认识她\N{\fnArial\fs30}You know her.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:51.05,0:25:53.71,Default,,0,0,0,,不管以何种方式 你们最终都来了这里\N{\fnArial\fs30}And somehow you both wound up here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:53.72,0:25:56.22,Default,,0,0,0,,也许这是有所暗示的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe that means something.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:56.22,0:25:59.35,Default,,0,0,0,,贝斯 你可以成为这里的一份子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beth, you can be a part of this thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:59.35,0:26:02.10,Default,,0,0,0,,你们俩都是\N{\fnArial\fs30}Both of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:02.11,0:26:04.31,Default,,0,0,0,,这很重要\N{\fnArial\fs30}This is important.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.31,0:26:07.86,Default,,0,0,0,,可能是你这辈子做的最重要的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}Maybe the most important thing you do in your life.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:07.86,0:26:10.28,Default,,0,0,0,,而你刚刚在那里做的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}And what you did back there...
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.87,0:26:21.62,Default,,0,0,0,,戈尔曼和奥唐纳害人不浅\N{\fnArial\fs30}Gorman and O'Donnell hurt people.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:23.49,0:26:26.45,Default,,0,0,0,,他们的死对这个世界没有任何损失\N{\fnArial\fs30}The world didn't lose anything when they died.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:28.68,0:26:30.35,Default,,0,0,0,,你刚刚那话也说错了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And you're wrong about what happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:30.35,0:26:32.22,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有利用你\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't use you.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:36.09,0:26:38.29,Default,,0,0,0,,我会记得死去的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I will remember.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:53.77,0:26:56.66,Default,,0,0,0,,你在自责\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're beating yourself up.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:56.66,0:26:57.99,Default,,0,0,0,,不要这样\N{\fnArial\fs30}Don't.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:59.61,0:27:01.45,Default,,0,0,0,,我当时犯傻了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was stupid.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:14.34,0:27:16.76,Default,,0,0,0,,在教堂\N{\fnArial\fs30}At the church,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:16.76,0:27:18.60,Default,,0,0,0,,你杀的那个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}that guy you killed,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.60,0:27:20.97,Default,,0,0,0,,他叫马丁\N{\fnArial\fs30}his name was Martin.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.47,0:27:24.47,Default,,0,0,0,,我们曾经抓到他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We had him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.47,0:27:26.31,Default,,0,0,0,,我和卡罗尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}Me and Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.31,0:27:29.11,Default,,0,0,0,,还在终点站的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}Back by Terminus.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.11,0:27:32.39,Default,,0,0,0,,后来 她跟着你们走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then she went in after you all
Dialogue: 0,0:27:32.40,0:27:34.31,Default,,0,0,0,,当时就只剩我和他\N{\fnArial\fs30}and it was just me and him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:35.35,0:27:37.42,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾说我杀死他了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I said I killed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:41.92,0:27:44.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我本可以那么做的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I could have done it,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:44.06,0:27:46.88,Default,,0,0,0,,也许我也应该那么做 但是...\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe I should have done it, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:27:46.88,0:27:48.46,Default,,0,0,0,,我没有\N{\fnArial\fs30}I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:50.55,0:27:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,我一直在想这件事\N{\fnArial\fs30}I keep thinking abt it.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.67,0:27:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,我记得我们还是孩子的时候\N{\fnArial\fs30}I remember when we were kids
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.51,0:28:01.51,Default,,0,0,0,,你常常跟着我到处跑\N{\fnArial\fs30}and you used to follow me around,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:01.51,0:28:03.51,Default,,0,0,0,,模仿我做的每件小事\N{\fnArial\fs30}copying every little thing I did.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:05.51,0:28:08.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们所经历的事\N{\fnArial\fs30}What happened to both of us,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:08.85,0:28:12.18,Default,,0,0,0,,也许是因为我们还是一样\N{\fnArial\fs30}maybe it's because we're still the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:13.69,0:28:16.41,Default,,0,0,0,,还是从前的样子\N{\fnArial\fs30}Just like we were back then.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:17.74,0:28:20.03,Default,,0,0,0,,也许这是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And maybe that's good.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:20.03,0:28:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,你的确没变\N{\fnArial\fs30}You're still the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:24.92,0:28:26.83,Default,,0,0,0,,这是好事\N{\fnArial\fs30}And that is good.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:30.70,0:28:32.76,Default,,0,0,0,,但我觉得我做不到\N{\fnArial\fs30}I don't think I can be.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:35.93,0:28:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,再也回不去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:40.35,0:28:42.10,Default,,0,0,0,,回不去了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.79,0:29:01.66,Default,,0,0,0,,他们正在往对我们有利的位置开\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're headed towards the vantage point.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.40,0:29:03.90,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:03.91,0:29:05.57,Default,,0,0,0,,收到\N{\fnArial\fs30}Copy that.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:31.90,0:29:35.15,Default,,0,0,0,,弗朗哥警官 麦金利警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}Officer Franco. Officer McGinley.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:36.52,0:29:39.32,Default,,0,0,0,,我是瑞克 格兰姆斯\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm Rick Grimes.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:39.32,0:29:42.78,Default,,0,0,0,,我曾是国王县治安局的副警长\N{\fnArial\fs30}I was a deputy in the King County Sheriff's Department.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:42.78,0:29:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,我来是想做个交易\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm here to make a proposal.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.25,0:29:47.95,Default,,0,0,0,,把你的枪放在地上\N{\fnArial\fs30}Lay your weapon on the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:50.08,0:29:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.62,0:30:27.39,Default,,0,0,0,,什么交易?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What's your proposal?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.39,0:30:31.59,Default,,0,0,0,,你们手里有我的两个人 我有你们的两个人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You have two of my people, I have two of yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:31.59,0:30:34.06,Default,,0,0,0,,我们想做个交换\N{\fnArial\fs30}We want to make an exchange.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:34.06,0:30:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,然后我们就各走各的路 没有人会受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}Then we'll be on our way. No one gets hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:41.55,0:30:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,- 谁?  - 谢帕德警官\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Who?  - Officers Shepherd
Dialogue: 0,0:30:44.01,0:30:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,和利卡里警官 换贝斯和卡罗尔\N{\fnArial\fs30}and Licari for Beth and Carol.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.09,0:30:52.06,Default,,0,0,0,,你们昨天用车撞了个女人\N{\fnArial\fs30}You picked up a woman yesterday
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.06,0:30:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,后来还把她带走了\N{\fnArial\fs30}after your people hit her with a car.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.07,0:31:03.36,Default,,0,0,0,,诺亚 他跟你在一起吗? 是他告诉你的?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah, he's with you? That's how you know?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:03.36,0:31:05.91,Default,,0,0,0,,是的\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yes, he is.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.91,0:31:07.69,Default,,0,0,0,,拉姆森警官呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}What about Officer Lamson?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:09.63,0:31:12.20,Default,,0,0,0,,我们找到他的时候 他已经被行尸弄死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was attacked by the dead before we got to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.07,0:31:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,你的人在哪儿?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where are your people?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.76,0:31:23.79,Default,,0,0,0,,他们离得很近\N{\fnArial\fs30}They're close.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.09,0:31:35.72,Default,,0,0,0,,用对讲机跟你们中尉报告 我会等着\N{\fnArial\fs30}Radio your lieutenant. I'll wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:12.55,0:33:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,把枪收进枪套里\N{\fnArial\fs30}Holster your weapons.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:16.05,0:33:17.67,Default,,0,0,0,,你也是\N{\fnArial\fs30}You, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.25,0:33:47.11,Default,,0,0,0,,他们没有受伤\N{\fnArial\fs30}They haven't been harmed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.28,0:33:50.28,Default,,0,0,0,,拉姆森在哪儿?\N{\fnArial\fs30}Where's Lamson?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.29,0:33:53.37,Default,,0,0,0,,行尸袭击了他\N{\fnArial\fs30}Rotters got him.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:53.37,0:33:56.21,Default,,0,0,0,,我们看到他死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}We saw it go down.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.51,0:33:59.38,Default,,0,0,0,,哦\N{\fnArial\fs30}Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:00.71,0:34:03.71,Default,,0,0,0,,真遗憾\N{\fnArial\fs30}I'm sorry to hear that.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:03.72,0:34:06.35,Default,,0,0,0,,他是个好人\N{\fnArial\fs30}He was one of the good guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:10.99,0:34:13.06,Default,,0,0,0,,一个换一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of yours for one of mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:14.56,0:34:15.78,Default,,0,0,0,,好的\N{\fnArial\fs30}All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:17.36,0:34:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,走\N{\fnArial\fs30}Move.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:01.61,0:35:03.91,Default,,0,0,0,,很高兴我们把事情解决了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Glad we could work things out.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.61,0:35:08.24,Default,,0,0,0,,是啊\N{\fnArial\fs30}Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:10.87,0:35:12.95,Default,,0,0,0,,现在我只要Noah\N{\fnArial\fs30}Now I just need Noah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:17.70,0:35:19.84,Default,,0,0,0,,然后你们就可以离开了\N{\fnArial\fs30}And then you can leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.21,0:35:23.96,Default,,0,0,0,,交易里可没这条\N{\fnArial\fs30}That wasn't part of the deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.96,0:35:26.13,Default,,0,0,0,,诺亚是我的人\N{\fnArial\fs30}Noah was my ward.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.13,0:35:29.38,Default,,0,0,0,,贝斯接替了他的位置 但她又离开了 所以我要他回来\N{\fnArial\fs30}Beth took his place and I'm losing her, so I need him back.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.38,0:35:31.60,Default,,0,0,0,,- 长官 这不...  - Shepherd!\N{\fnArial\fs30}- Ma'am, please, it's not...  - Shepherd!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:33.44,0:35:36.27,Default,,0,0,0,,我的警官们冒着生命危险出去找他\N{\fnArial\fs30}My officers put their lives on the line to find him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.27,0:35:38.61,Default,,0,0,0,,他们中死了一个\N{\fnArial\fs30}One of them died.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:38.61,0:35:41.11,Default,,0,0,0,,不 他不会留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}No, he ain't staying.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:41.11,0:35:43.40,Default,,0,0,0,,他是我的人 你们无权带走他\N{\fnArial\fs30}He's one of mine. You have no claim on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.40,0:35:46.65,Default,,0,0,0,,这孩子想回家 所以你无权留下他\N{\fnArial\fs30}The boy wants to go home, so you have no claim on him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:49.40,0:35:50.95,Default,,0,0,0,,这样我们就做不成交易了\N{\fnArial\fs30}Well, then we don't have a deal.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:50.96,0:35:52.57,Default,,0,0,0,,交易已经结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}The deal is done.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:52.57,0:35:54.49,Default,,0,0,0,,- 没关系  - 不 不行\N{\fnArial\fs30}- It's okay.  - No. No.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.99,0:35:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,我要留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}I got to do it.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.83,0:36:04.33,Default,,0,0,0,,不可以\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's not okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:04.34,0:36:06.34,Default,,0,0,0,,就这么定了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's settled.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:09.17,0:36:11.22,Default,,0,0,0,,等等!\N{\fnArial\fs30}Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:16.76,0:36:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,没关系\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:20.35,0:36:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,我知道你会回来的\N{\fnArial\fs30}I knew you'd be back.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:38.37,0:36:40.84,Default,,0,0,0,,我现在明白了\N{\fnArial\fs30}I get it now.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:10.90,0:37:12.62,Default,,0,0,0,,不! 别开枪!\N{\fnArial\fs30}No! Hold your fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.16,0:37:17.46,Default,,0,0,0,,结束了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:18.58,0:37:20.79,Default,,0,0,0,,她已经死了\N{\fnArial\fs30}It was just about her.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:23.41,0:37:25.68,Default,,0,0,0,,放下\N{\fnArial\fs30}Stand down.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:06.37,0:38:08.34,Default,,0,0,0,,你们可以留下\N{\fnArial\fs30}You can stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:10.79,0:38:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,我们在这里活得很好\N{\fnArial\fs30}We're surviving here.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:13.38,0:38:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,比外面好\N{\fnArial\fs30}It's better than out there.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:17.22,0:38:19.22,Default,,0,0,0,,不\N{\fnArial\fs30}No.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:21.56,0:38:24.64,Default,,0,0,0,,我还要把想走的人一起带走\N{\fnArial\fs30}And I'm taking anyone back there who wants to leave.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.70,0:38:30.95,Default,,0,0,0,,如果想跟我们一起走的...\N{\fnArial\fs30}If you want to come with us...
Dialogue: 0,0:38:34.12,0:38:36.15,Default,,0,0,0,,现在就站出来\N{\fnArial\fs30}just step forward now.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:00.00,0:40:04.00,Default,,0,0,0,,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:17.12,0:40:22.35,Default,,0,0,0,, 《行尸走肉》将于二月回归\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\an8}AMC's The Walking Dead returns with new episodes this February.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:23.02,0:40:24.85,Default,,0,0,0,,我们离那里有几百英里\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\an8}We are hundreds miles away.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:24.95,0:40:27.25,Default,,0,0,0,,要有地方能让我们安全留下呢?\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\an8}What if some place we can be safe?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:29.72,0:40:31.15,Default,,0,0,0,,是个机会\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\an8}It's a chance.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:32.72,0:40:35.05,Default,,0,0,0,,总好过留在外面\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\an8}Instead of just being out here.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:36.22,0:40:37.65,Default,,0,0,0,,总好过白手起家\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\an8}Instead of just making it.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:39.72,0:40:41.05,Default,,0,0,0,,我们没事\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\an8}We're okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:42.22,0:40:46.05,Default,,0,0,0,,因为这才是我们的生存之道\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\an8}Because this is how we survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:46.12,0:40:50.15,Default,,0,0,0,, 《行尸走肉》将于二月回归\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\an8}The Walking Dead returns with new episodes this February.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:50.25,0:40:51.95,Default,,0,0,0,,AMC台呈献\N{\fnArial\fs30}{\an8}Only on AMC.
Dialogue: 0,0:43:07.25,0:43:12.55,Default,,0,0,0,,(抱歉 我太混蛋了 一定要来华盛顿 新世界需要瑞克 格兰姆斯)
